      "datasource": {"type": "datasource", "uid": "grafana"},
      "gridPos": {"h": 6, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 30},
      "id": 10,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## AWS / ECS panels\n\nPhase 6 adds two CloudWatch-backed panels here:\n\n- **ECS Container Insights** — `AWS/ECS/ContainerInsights` `CpuUtilized` + `MemoryUtilized` for `ServiceName=ams-backend|ams-frontend`, `ClusterName=ams-prod`.\n- **ALB metrics** — `AWS/ApplicationELB` `RequestCount`, `TargetResponseTime` (p95), `HTTPCode_Target_5XX_Count`.\n\nThe `cloudwatch` datasource is provisioned by Phase 6's `cloudwatch.yml`. Until the credentials referenced in `backend/.env.example` are set in `.env` at the repo root, those panels load with `No data` and the rest of the dashboard continues to work."
      },
      "title": "AWS ECS + ALB (Phase 6 placeholder)",
      "type": "text"
    }
